# Software industry mapping for SAM
@prefix sw: <https://ecosystemcode.com/ontology/sam/software#> .
@prefix legacy: <https://example.com/legacy/software#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

legacy:application_alarm owl:equivalentClass sw:ApplicationAlarm .
legacy:application_alarm_id rdfs:subPropertyOf sw:applicationAlarmId .
legacy:tenant_impact owl:equivalentClass sw:TenantImpact .
legacy:tenant_impact_id rdfs:subPropertyOf sw:tenantImpactId .
legacy:assesses_application_alarm rdfs:subPropertyOf sw:assessesApplicationAlarm .
legacy:affects_software_tenant rdfs:subPropertyOf sw:affectsSoftwareTenant .
